      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAR FURY (2) hit the ground running last time with a fast early split and never headed, leading throughout to win by 1.1 lengths (22.91) over 400m at Warragul. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including three wins, from seven starts. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. KRAKEN BLUEY (1) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 5 winner three back (22.50) at this track over 390m. Can turn it around this time. DIM SIM OLLIE (5) was below best last time finishing fourth at Bendigo, but prior to that had been racing well including a Grade 5 win two back at this track. Has the ability and can find best this time. SCOTT CHARISMA (7) will have admirers again after a narrow placing last time out.",
